<Base title="About" description="Vietnam Guide is a reference for planning a trip. Each place uses the same facts: what it is, how worthwhile the visit is, how to get there, and what it costs to enter when a fee exists." path="/about" ogType="website">
  <article class="wrap reading section">
    <Crumbs items={[{ name: 'About' }]} />
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>Vietnam Guide is a reference for planning a trip. Each place uses the same facts: what it is, how worthwhile the visit is, how to get there, and what it costs to enter when a fee exists.</p>
    <p>Editorial dots are a judgment set by the editors. Visit rank is separate and stays hidden until a place has enough measured traffic. Sponsored links cannot change either one.</p>
    <p>Pages are JSON records in this site’s repository. The schema is checked before a build. See <a href="/about/editing">how to update a page</a>.</p>
    <p><a href="/about/ratings">How ratings work</a> · <a href="/about/partners">Partners</a> · <a href="/about/corrections">Corrections</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>
